        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste paper, mixed, from public collection, for further treatment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste paper, mixed, from public collection, for further treatment
na;
UUID: 60914a9e-c8b0-3005-ba2b-763d7b9fff34
This module includes the transportation efforts for the collection as well as the fruther transportation to the next paper production site / paper sorting plant. No further efforts are included into this module. The collected waste paper has a biogenic C content of 40.4% (average C-content of waste paper according to Doka 2004); Geography: Estimation from the author of the study, valuable for Europe.
Location:  Estimation from the author of the study, valuable for Europe.
Technology: Special lorry for collection - then average lorry for further transports
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: European collection: 42'960 kt (CEPI-statistics)
Sampling: Estimation 
Extrapolations: see geography and technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_60914a9e-c8b0-3005-ba2b-763d7b9fff34.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
